;\n      background: #edf1f9;\n      border-right: 2px solid #667b80;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .section-content {\n      padding: 8px 7px 7px 6px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.48;\n      background: #edf1f9;\n    }\n\n    .airport-content {\n      min-height: 214px;\n    }\n\n    .city-content {\n      min-height: 109px;\n    }\n\n    .rental-content {\n      min-height: 281px;\n      padding-top: 8px;\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .item {\n      margin: 0 0 3px 0;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .item:last-child {\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .red {\n      color: #e00000;\n    }\n\n    .rental-content .item {\n      line-height: 1.48;\n      margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .quote {\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"headline\">\n      去张家界<span class=\"accent\">6次</span>整理<span class=\"accent\">8千</span>字干货\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">交通篇（含租车细节）</div>\n\n    <table class=\"layout\" aria-label=\"张家界交通与租车信息\">\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"section-label\">机场→市区</td>\n        <td class=\"section-content airport-content\">\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            1、<span class=\"red\">机场大巴：</span>实际上是中巴车，写有“张家界机场大酒店”或张家界荷花机场”字样，一般停在机场出口，十几分钟路程，5元到市区的机场大酒店。\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            2、<span class=\"red\">公交：</span>乘坐4路公交车（8:00-18:00）钟进入市区，票价1元(无人售票)，约0.5小时到。机场大门口前100m处为4路公交车站，此外环城线，此为AB线，故建议上车前先向乘务员咨询所去目的地的地/区乘坐路线，及转车地点。\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"section-label\">市内</td>\n        <td class=\"section-content city-content\">\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            1、<span class=\"red\">张家界市区内班车：</span>在火车站旁边的汽车站乘坐到武陵源区或者张家界国家森林公园的线路车，15分钟左右一般，到张家界国家森林公园门票站大约20元/人，车程50分钟左右。\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            2、张家界市区<span class=\"red\">打车</span>到武陵源景区大概100元左右。\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            3、<span class=\"red\">自驾</span>车过去的话，只能停车在门票站外，停车费大概在50元/天。\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"section-label\">租车细则</td>\n        <td class=\"section-content rental-content\">\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            1.租车要提前预定，旺季需<span class=\"red\">提前3天</span>预定好\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            2.选靠谱的<span class=\"red\">正规大型平台</span>租车，不考虑小平台\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            3.不管是哪個平台租车都要<span class=\"red\">买好车险</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            4.租车的时候要检查车况，车胎/胎压/刹车/换胎工具/应急工具等等，最好好是拍照/录视频记录一下，车子里也要拍照留底，一旦发现车子有损坏的地方，立马跟平台说明情况，请求换车处理\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            5.租车平台参考：<span class=\"red\">tb/飞猪/携程/一嗨/神州</span>（自己对比选择）\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            6.价格：一般一天200~300，<span class=\"red\">押金5000</span>，15天后无纠纷原路退回\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            7.<span class=\"red\">第一次去不建议租车</span>，不熟悉路况，容易刮蹭车也怕事故\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
